      '<div class="result-section"><h4>Pressure and decision-protection playbook</h4><p>These scores identify planning priorities from the same answers. They are not mental-health measures or predictions of burnout.</p><details><summary>Open pressure signals, trainable behaviours, and decision journal</summary><h5>Four pressure patterns to monitor first</h5><div class="insight-grid">'+pressure+'</div><h5 class="playbook-heading">Behaviours and systems that can be developed</h5>'+listHtml(r.trainableBehaviours)+'<h5 class="playbook-heading">Use this decision journal before a costly commitment</h5>'+listHtml(r.decisionJournal)+'</details></div>'+
      '<div class="result-section"><h4>Your 90-day development roadmap</h4>'+listHtml(r.ninetyDayPlan)+'</div>';
